            "max_check_attempts": 5,
            "notes": "Compares the Linuxfabrik objects in the Icinga Director (data fields, commands, host and service templates, Service Sets) with the Director basket that ships with the installed plugins. Alerts if one of them is missing in the Director or differs from the basket: either it was changed in the Director, and the next import of the basket would overwrite that change, or the basket of a newer plugin release has not been imported yet. Says what to do about it. Objects of your own are not checked. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy.",
